 for  the beautiful like dance sequences yeah  i actually think that it came at a time  where everybody was looking for joy  everyone was looking for escapism and  then the final element i think is that  um  with the representation and diversity  that you see on screen i think that it  also diversifies the audience certainly  everyone loves to feel seen on screen  and when you have such a beautiful  multi-racial cast like we do  of course it's going to attract a  bigger audience and for so long you know  i think that  there's been like this consensus within  within the industry that like that's  something that's risky or that's going  to be unpopular and bridgeton's here to  tell you that it's quite frankly the  opposite no i love that  i'm so proud of you guys congratulations  to all of you season two is amazing i  can't wait for everyone to see it thank  you so much take care thanks everyone

